      "excerpt": "Nigate Tale gives you total freedom to choose your own playstyle, with dozens of weapons of all kinds (melee and ranged, slow but strong and weak but fast…), different types of magic , and several skills trees for you to level up, creating in every playthrough a unique character to fight with.",
